The following examples demonstrate multiple file upload in a component. GetMultipleFiles allows reading multiple files. Specify the maximum number of files to prevent a malicious user from uploading a larger number of files than the app expects. File allows reading the first and only file if the file upload doesn't support multiple files.

InputFileChangeEventArgs is in the Forms namespace, which is typically one of the namespaces in the app's imports file (`_Imports.razor`). When the namespace is present in the imports file, it provides API member access to the app's components.

Namespaces in the imports file aren't applied to C# files (`.cs`). C# files require an explicit `using` directive at the top of the class file:

```razor
