Example 2: Set the Information log level with an integer value.

Blazor Web App:

```html
<script src="{BLAZOR SCRIPT}" autostart="false"></script>
<script>
  Blazor.start({
    circuit: {
      configureSignalR: function (builder) {
        builder.configureLogging(2); // LogLevel.Information
